            <h5>2. Security deposit</h5>
            <p>A refundable security deposit is charged with every booking and returned when the
                dress is returned undamaged.</p>
            <h5>3. Damage &amp; cleaning</h5>
            <p>Damage beyond normal wear is deducted from the deposit. Heavy cleaning required
                after events (stains, make-up, perfume) may attract a cleaning fee.</p>
            <h5>4. Cancellation</h5>
            <p>Bookings can be cancelled before approval without charge. After approval, contact
                the dress owner directly.</p>
            <h5>5. Accounts</h5>
            <p>One account per person. Owners are responsible for the accuracy of the dress
                listings they publish.</p>
